     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">OMAHA -- Warren Buffett, Debbie Bosanek, Carrie Sova, Tracy Britt Cool, Ted Weschler and Todd Combs pose with other Berkshire Hathaway employees before the Christmas lunch at Omaha Country Club on December 2, 2014. (Photo by Matt Miller)</rdf:li>
